I haven't said too much recently, so here is a spoiler.
It is called Vlad's Castle.  Actually, it IS Vlad's castle, so the name is
good.  Vlad the Impaler is on the thirs floor.  You have to enter on the
first floor of the castle and work your way up.  Then, after you kill him,
the six other vampires(Lords?  i can't remember) you have to climb BACK
down and go to the other staircase.  I think that the normal set is usually
in the NW corner, but I am not sure.  There is a lot of nice stuff in the
castle, but it takes some time and the risks may be great.

